WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.167
-This is how you play the game.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.400
How you play the game
is you take

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.200
two ping-pong balls, right,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.901
and then you try to --
you stand on that side

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.734
and you try to throw it and
land it any of my cups of beer.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:12.300
And if you land it in a cup,
I drink the beer in the cup.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.934
-Oh, wonderful.
And if I'm very, very good,

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:18.133
we carry him out.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:23.300
♪♪

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.200
-Alright, get ready.
I'm gonna be honest.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.267
When I play this game,
I play for blood.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:32.167
-Me too. Oh, me too. No pity.
-No kidding. No joking around.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:35.133
Alright, you can go first.
Roots, a little music?

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:37.067
-Who's first?
-You go first.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.133
Please, after you.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:41.734
♪♪

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:42.968
Oh, yeah. Sorry. You go.

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:46.133
♪♪

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.133
[ Laughs ]

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:57.067
♪♪

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.367
-Come on, Betty!

00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:02.667
-This is insane!
This is insane.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.601
